# Required for `make input`: the value of the "session" cookie from
# adventofcode.com (log in, then find it in your browser's dev tools under
# cookies). Treat it like a password. Exporting it in your shell also works.
# AOC_SESSION=

# Optional: AoC asks scripts to identify themselves with contact info in the
# User-Agent. Without it, the generic "aoc-makefile-input" is sent.
# AOC_UA=github.com/<you>/AoC by <you>@example.com
